{"id":"n2-098","title":"～としたら (〜to shitara)","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Express a hypothetical situation; 'if', 'suppose', 'assuming'.","longExplanation":"The ～としたら grammar point is used to express a hypothetical situation or assumption. It can be translated as 'if', 'suppose', or 'assuming' in English. The formation differs depending on whether it’s used with verbs, adjectives, or nouns.","formation":"Verb-casual + としたら, い-Adjective + としたら, な-Adjective + だとしたら, Noun + だとしたら","examples":[{"jp":"明日雨が降るとしたら、傘を持っていきましょう。","romaji":"Ashita ame ga furu to shitara, kasa o motte ikimashō.","en":"If it rains tomorrow, let’s bring umbrellas.","words":[{"surface":"明日","vocabId":"1584660","reading":"あした"},{"surface":"雨","vocabId":"1171900","reading":"あめ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"降る","vocabId":"1282790","reading":"ふる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"傘","vocabId":"1301940","reading":"かさ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"持っ","vocabId":"1315720","reading":"もつ"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いき","vocabId":"1404320","reading":"いき"},{"surface":"ましょ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"このケーキが美味しくないとしたら、誰も食べないだろう。","romaji":"Kono kēki ga oishikunai to shitara, dare mo tabenai darō.","en":"If this cake isn’t tasty, probably no one will eat it.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ケーキ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"美味しく","vocabId":"1486650","reading":"おいしい"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"誰","vocabId":"1416830","reading":"だれ"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"食べ","vocabId":"1358280","reading":"たべる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"だろ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"彼が病気だとしたら、早めに病院へ行かないといけません。","romaji":"Kare ga byōki da to shitara, hayame ni byōin e ikanai to ikemasen.","en":"If he is sick, he needs to go to the hospital soon.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"病気","vocabId":"1490230","reading":"びょうき"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"早め","vocabId":"2078850","reading":"はやめ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"病院","vocabId":"1490220","reading":"びょういん"},{"surface":"へ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行か","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いく"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いけ","vocabId":"1421700","reading":"いけ"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"彼女が学生だとしたら、このレストランは割引があるでしょう。","romaji":"Kanojo ga gakusei da to shitara, kono resutoran wa waribiki ga aru deshō.","en":"If she’s a student, there’s probably a discount at this restaurant.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"学生","vocabId":"1206900","reading":"がくせい"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"レストラン","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"割引","vocabId":"1606950","reading":"わりびき"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ある","vocabId":"1296400","reading":"ある"},{"surface":"でしょ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]}]}